Wed 03:22 STAGE summary
MULTI-SEED PILOT (v14). Tables in analysis/v14/. Self = largest co-firing group per layer, |correlation| >= 0.2, FLORES dev.
Lesion tests are count-matched (same number of self and task neurons per layer). Lesion without training: every checkpoint from phase 4 until the model loses plasticity (at most phase 30). Lesion + training: every 2. of those checkpoints. Persistence: every phase change from 6->7 on.
s1, s2, s3 = new seeds. old0, old1 = the earlier single runs (same recipe), analysed with the same code.

